msgstr "Lánaimseartha (níos mó ná 30 uair an chloig)"

msgid "Part time intensive "
msgstr "Sceideal dian páirtaimseartha"

msgid "Part time intensive (8 to 30 hours)"
msgstr "Sceideal dian páirtaimseartha (8 go 30 uair an chloig)"
